{"product_id":"drop-piasara","title":"Drop Pisara","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a wood-heated bath around the year!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe drop theme appears in both the design of the products as well as the name of the company. The first Drop spa pools came with a stove and, back then, it was the only available heating option. That’s why this pool package was named Pisara, which is Finnish for drop. It’s the pool that started everything.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Pisara spa pool has an incredibly efficient and stylish Black Box stove with a heating time that only the top of the industry offers — approximately 2 hours. The bather can sense the heat of the stove, the smell of the chopped wood and the atmospheric flames behind the stove’s glass door.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pool takes a traditional hot tub experience one drop further.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: approx. *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 240 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight of the stove: approx. 40 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 1.4em;\"\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe package includes everything you need to use a traditional pool with a wood stove.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey, or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressure-treated wood frame for the pool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e35 kW Black Box stove\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChimney and protective grill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsh spade\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll necessary hoses and clamps for the stove.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":44553776628036,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":44553776660804,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey","offer_id":44553776693572,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black","offer_id":47718763430212,"sku":"","price":9000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_249a98b9-de06-4724-aaef-ab2e0d487e7a.jpg?v=1677687045","url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/products\/drop-piasara","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}